WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.922
Muhandislikda kuchlanish kalit bilan ulanadi yoki qisqa impuls keladi.

2
00:00:05.922 --> 00:00:14.383
Bunday uzilishli manbalar bilan klassik usullar noqulay, Laplas usuli esa ularni oson hisobga oladi.

3
00:00:14.383 --> 00:00:18.782
Bu qismda pog‘ona, impuls va RLC zanjirini ko‘ramiz.

4
00:00:19.032 --> 00:00:25.138
Xevisayd funksiyasi u t minus c, c gacha nol, keyin bir.

5
00:00:25.138 --> 00:00:35.604
Ikkinchi siljish teoremasi: c ga kechiktirilgan funksiyaning tasviri e daraja minus c s karra F.

6
00:00:35.604 --> 00:00:42.800
Dirak impulsi delta t minus c ning tasviri esa e daraja minus c s.

7
00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:47.270
O‘ram tasvirlar ko‘paytmasiga mos keladi.

8
00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:54.282
RLC zanjiri: induktivlik bir, qarshilik ikki, sig‘im nol butun o‘ndan ikki.

9
00:00:54.282 --> 00:00:56.807
Nol vaqtda o‘n volt ulanadi.

10
00:00:56.807 --> 00:01:05.462
Zaryad uchun q ikki shtrix plyus ikki q shtrix plyus besh q teng o‘n, boshlang‘ich shartlar nol.

11
00:01:05.712 --> 00:01:12.383
Q teng o‘n bo‘lingan s karra s kvadrat plyus ikki s plyus besh.

12
00:01:12.383 --> 00:01:23.396
Sodda kasrlar: ikki bo‘lingan s minus ikki karra s plyus ikki bo‘lingan s plyus bir kvadrat plyus to‘rt.

13
00:01:23.396 --> 00:01:29.750
Maxrajda kvadratni to‘ldirdik, chunki haqiqiy ildizlar yo‘q.

14
00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:42.106
Birinchi siljish teoremasi bilan qaytamiz: q teng ikki minus e daraja minus t karra ikki kosinus ikki t plyus sinus ikki t.

15
00:01:42.106 --> 00:01:51.062
Impuls javobi, ya’ni uzatish funksiyasining originali, yarim e daraja minus t sinus ikki t.

16
00:01:51.312 --> 00:01:56.841
Grafikda zaryad ikki kulonga intiladi, ya’ni sig‘im karra kuchlanishga.

17
00:01:56.841 --> 00:02:08.366
Yo‘lda u biroz oshib ketadi va so‘nuvchi tebranish bilan barqarorlashadi: bu xarakteristik ildizlar kompleks va haqiqiy qismi manfiy bo‘lgani uchun.

18
00:02:08.616 --> 00:02:15.635
Savol: e daraja minus uch s karra F katta s tasvirning originali qanday?

19
00:02:15.635 --> 00:02:20.022
Videoni to‘xtating, javobni o‘zingiz tanlang,

20
00:02:20.022 --> 00:02:26.846
so‘ng izohni o‘qing va kerak bo‘lsa darsning tegishli qismiga qayting.
